_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.stable, 4.6.3.stable, 4.6.2.stable, and later\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.7.stable - NVidia RTX 3070\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating a shader that has a uniform of type `sampler2DArray` with the hint `hint_default_transparent`, Godot gives an error until the uniform is provided : \n\n```\nERROR: Uniforms were never supplied for set (3) at the time of drawing, which are required by the pipeline.\n```\n\nThe error is spamming forever.\n\nProviding a temporary `PlaceholderTexture2DArray` fixes the issue if you don't have Texture2DArray yet available but it's a patch.\n\n<img width=\"2534\" height=\"1320\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df22e0ea-5a17-4977-b2d7-21637d40f5d0\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new 3D Scene\n- Add a new `MeshInstance3D`\n- Provide a `Mesh` for the `MeshInstance3D`\n- Create a `ShaderMaterial` on the MeshInstance (MaterialOverride does the trick)\n- Add the following simple shader : \n- \n```glsl\nshader_type spatial;\n\nuniform sampler2DArray test: hint_default_transparent, repeat_disable;\n```\n- See the error spamming the console\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shader_error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29114980/shader_error.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120417/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}